    }, {
      "name" : "Description",
      "value" : "Transcription profiling from human primary fibroblasts as they progress into senescence. Samples were taken early population doubling onwards until cells reached replicative senescence and stopped dividing. Population doubling values are contained in Characteristics[generation] column."
