        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "All experiments were performed using IMR90 cells, which were grown in DMEM medium containing 15% Fetal Bovine Serum, antibiotics (Penicillin, Streptomycin), and non-essential amino acids. Cells were grown at 7.5% CO2 and 3.5% O2"
